			"notes": "The first official release of **The Crown of Chaos**, a Fabric mod for Minecraft 26.2.\n\nCraft the Golden Crown, upgrade it into nine magical crowns (each with a netherite version, passive effects and one or two abilities), build a faction with an army of units, then fight the Chaos King in his arena to earn the Crown of Chaos.\n\n**Install:** needs Minecraft 26.2, Fabric Loader and Fabric API. Put `crown-of-chaos-1.0.0.jar` in your `mods` folder. The README has the full guide."
